Title:          thinkfan.tcz
Description:    simple, lightweight fan control program for thinkpads
Version:        2.0.0
Author:         see list of sites below
Original-site:  see list of sites below
Copying-policy: see list of sites below
Size:		176K
Extension_by:   gnuser
Tags:           thinkpad fan
Comments:       ----------
                How-to:
                1. Boot with this bootcode: thinkpad_acpi.fan_control=1
                2. Copy the example config file /usr/local/etc/thinkfan.conf.example to /usr/local/etc/thinkfan.conf
                3. Edit /usr/local/etc/thinkfan.conf as appropriate for your hardware and add it to your backup
                4. Start the daemon: $ sudo thinkfan &
